    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="note_D01">
      <bpmn:text>D01 | learned XOR rules
Test accuracy: 0.962

B1: hist.offers_so_far &lt;= 1.5
B1: hist.offers_so_far &gt; 1.5 AND hist.last_activity_count &gt; 1.5 AND
    hist.offers_so_far &lt;= 2.5
B1: hist.offers_so_far &gt; 1.5 AND hist.last_activity_count &gt; 1.5 AND
    hist.offers_so_far &gt; 2.5 AND hist.last_activity_count &gt; 2.5 AND
    hist.offers_so_far &lt;= 3.5

B2: hist.offers_so_far &gt; 1.5 AND hist.last_activity_count &lt;= 1.5
B2: hist.offers_so_far &gt; 1.5 AND hist.last_activity_count &gt; 1.5 AND
    hist.offers_so_far &gt; 2.5 AND hist.last_activity_count &lt;= 2.5
B2: hist.offers_so_far &gt; 1.5 AND hist.last_activity_count &gt; 1.5 AND
    hist.offers_so_far &gt; 2.5 AND hist.last_activity_count &gt; 2.5 AND
    hist.offers_so_far &gt; 3.5

last. = last synchronized offer value
hist. = case history before this decision
Learned associations; not bank policy.</bpmn:text>
